*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*4 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Madam Peng]]s spawn after 11.33 seconds<sup>340f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Archbaron Face]] spawns after 55 seconds<sup>1,650f</sup>.
*5 [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
